ions ["q-105160"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "88b2e377-967b-5de7-a80d-5baf2cd84ed4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "5176f94c-b3d7-55f0-9831-90bc130fe9b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "4b22f19e-e9b4-54cc-8cd4-9986bf169493" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "04b6a111-8cac-5c02-9414-65cd5b91df66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "f13db315-f288-5d89-bada-ac6e93226221" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d7a11e8-42ec-55ae-a6a2-8e71f70e7335" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-105167/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-105167/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-105167/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-105167/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-105167/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" "q-105167/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-105167" :question/id #uuid "8f4cc426-8edc-5853-97ca-58831fd58674" :question/math-academy-id "q-105167" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1} \\\\ -3{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-7{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-7{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-7{x}_{2}=-9 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=3 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} & =-6 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=3 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5(3) & =3 \\\\ -3{x}_{1} & =-12 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=3$ into the third equation and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ (4)-(3) & =1 \\\\ 1 & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=3,$ which means\n\n$$\n4{a}_{1}+3{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=4+3=7.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-105167/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105167"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
